<title>UK: ECC says profits, sales higher in 5-mths.</title>
<headline>ECC says profits, sales higher in 5-mths.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building materials supplier English China Clays Plc said on Friday that profits were up in all its operations in the first five months despite only modest recovery in market conditions.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that sales volumes in Europe were up by four percent from a year earlier and margins had improved &quot;considerably&quot; because of cost cutting.</p>
</text>
